  "details": "Simply put, the new keyboard layout right now sucks.\n\nSeriously.. two button presses to access most keys and it feels crammed when typing, For mobile platforms it's fine, not for us VR players.\n\nMy suggestion is a setting that **REVITALIZES** the old keyboard layout.\n\nYes, the keyword is ***revitalize***, Make the new keyboard's layout match almost EXACTLY to the old one as a setting, showed on the first two pictures.\n\nBecause in my experience, it's a hell lot more accessible that way, and also, i don't want to press two separate buttons to access most keys, this and the crammed feeling can impact how fast you can type in VR.\n\nAnother thing that I'm very negative about is that the input field UI (from what i heard) cannot be moved around BY DESIGN, which contributes to the unnatural position of this new keyboard and it strains my wrists over-time.\n\nlastly, this whole thing feels rushed.",
